  "markup": "\u003Cp \u003E\u2022 LOB: System Integration \u2013 KSA\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003E\u2022 Number of needed candidates : 1 (Internal Vacancy)\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003E\u2022 Reporting to: Sales Manager (KSA)\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003E\u2022 Location: Egypt, Cairo\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003EJob description:\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003EJob roles and responsibilities:\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Eo Lead generation: Conduct lead generation, prospecting, and qualification of\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Epotential new clients.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Eo Support Sales Team: Assist the sales team with administrative tasks, scheduling\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Emeetings, and preparing for sales presentations.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Eo CRM Management: Maintain and update the customer relationship\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Emanagement (CRM) system with accurate customer and sales data.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Eo Sales Reports: Generate and distribute sales reports to the sales team and\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Emanagement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Eo Internal communications: Serve as the liaison between the sales team and\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Einternal departments for all related requests.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003ERequired Experience:\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Eo Minimum 1\u20132 years of experience in similar role preferably in IT solutions or\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Esystem integration.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Eo Strong understanding of the sales process and a customer-focused approach.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Eo Excellent communication and interpersonal skills.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Eo Familiarity with software solutions is a plus.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp \u003Eo Bachelor\u2019s degree in business, or a related field is preferred.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
