    <shortDescription>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Centro is seeking a detail-oriented and proactive Sales Support Specialist to join our System Integration team in KSA. You will play a crucial role in supporting the sales team by generating leads, managing CRM data, and facilitating smooth internal communications. The ideal candidate is organized, collaborative, and eager to contribute to a dynamic sales environment.]]></Value>
